From: Gleb Pesin <dormancygrace@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Makefile: optimize the firmware for size

At -O2 the SG2002 RX region (text, rodata, relocations) is 146 KB, so the
power-of-two RX/RW split puts the RW sections at 256 KiB and fw_dynamic.bin
carries 110 KB of zeros. At -Os with the RVV 1.0 code disabled it fits
under 128 KiB, and the FSBL reads 131 KB less from the SD card.
---
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -453,7 +453,7 @@
 CFLAGS		+=	-O0
 CPPFLAGS	+=	-DOPENSBI_DEBUG
 else
-CFLAGS		+=	-O2
+CFLAGS		+=	-Os
 endif
 
 ifeq ($(UBSAN),y)
